1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:02,620
Stop saying these three English phrases!

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,980
Don't say: I have a doubt.

3
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:06,850
Say: I have a question.

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,701
A doubt means you are not sure

5
00:00:08,551 --> 00:00:09,610
something is true.

6
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:12,710
Don't say: Please revert back.

7
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:14,510
Say: Please reply.

8
00:00:14,790 --> 00:00:17,087
Revert means going back to an earlier

9
00:00:16,937 --> 00:00:17,340
state.

10
00:00:18,496 --> 00:00:20,116
Don't say: Myself Ali.

11
00:00:20,446 --> 00:00:21,736
Say: I'm Ali.

12
00:00:21,996 --> 00:00:24,656
To introduce yourself, say I'm, not myself.

13
00:00:25,609 --> 00:00:27,721
Save this for later, and follow for

14
00:00:27,571 --> 00:00:28,919
a new fix every day.
